    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "\"This CD-ROM contains CHIRP subbottom and navigation data from a two week cruise from April 9-22, 1999 aboard the R/V GYRE. The objective of the cruise focussed on mapping surficial sedimentary processes and their connection to the subsurface geology on the upper continental slope in the northwestern Gulf of Mexico.\"",
